  "title": "Chile Colorado",
  "description": "A traditional Chile Colorado — a Mexican stewed dish &#34;colored red&#34; by red chiles cooked low and slow with beef. This is comforting and delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "VARISSUL"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:30:24-04:00",
